  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RESTORATION &amp; MANAGEMENT OF CRITI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Long-term conservation agreements will be established to protect 12,355 acres of a ranch in the southern portion of Laguna Madre. A current agreement for protection on a different ranch will be extended to continue protection on 5,043 acres. These actions will protect 776 acres of freshwater wetlands. The project will also build a system of drains, improve solid waste management and put up livestock exclusion fences. Plans addressing the protection of seagrass, climate change impacts, and environmental education will be developed and implemented.....</narrative>
  </description>
